# Niche Research — optional configuration.
# NOTE: API keys are read from your competitors.txt (any line containing AIza...), NOT from here.
# This file only holds optional knobs. Copy to ".env" if you want to override defaults.

# Extra YouTube Data API keys can also live in competitors.txt (one per line) for more daily quota.
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=AIzaSy-DAN-KHOA-CUA-BAN-VAO-DAY-1
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=AIzaSy-DAN-KHOA-CUA-BAN-VAO-DAY-2

# Transcript API key (only needed for the DNA deep-dive stages S15/S16, run via the agent specs).
# TRANSCRIPT_API_KEY=sk_DAN-KHOA-TRANSCRIPT-CUA-BAN-VAO-DAY

# Cap comments fetched per video in the info-gap stage (S4). Default in scripts/3_comments.py.
# MAX_COMMENTS=100

# HARD SHORTS GATE — Shorts (<=180s) are completely excluded from scan + every analysis stage,
# because the Shorts feed's distribution makes their view counts incomparable to long-form.
# Default ON. Only set "off" for a deliberately Shorts-first niche.
# SHORTS_GATE=off

# Optional: install `jsonschema` to turn the orchestrator's schema gate from a shallow key-check
# into full JSON-Schema validation:  pip install jsonschema

# ---- LLM judgement stages (S9b namer / S12 Auditor / S13 plan / S16-17 DNA) — run with --llm ----
# Any provider works: anthropic (Claude) | openai (ChatGPT) | glm | grok | custom (any
# OpenAI-compatible endpoint). Uncomment ONE LLM_PROVIDER + its matching key/model below.
# LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5

# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o

# GLM_API_KEY=
# GLM_MODEL=glm-5.2
# GLM_BASE_URL=https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4
#   (default is the Z.AI international endpoint — docs.z.ai. If your key is from the domestic
#   Zhipu console instead (bigmodel.cn), set GLM_BASE_URL=https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4)

# GROK_API_KEY=
# GROK_MODEL=grok-4
# GROK_BASE_URL=https://api.x.ai/v1

# Any other OpenAI-compatible provider:
# CUSTOM_BASE_URL=
# CUSTOM_API_KEY=
# CUSTOM_MODEL=

# The Auditor (S12) should be a DIFFERENT model than the rest — real critique, not a rubber stamp.
# Falls back to LLM_PROVIDER (with a warning) if left unset.
# AUDITOR_LLM_PROVIDER=glm
